  "skill_name": "Create a program that prints the multiplication table of a given number.",
  "workflow": "Program: \n\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main() \n{\n    int n = 5; \n    int i;\n \n    for (i = 1; i <= 10; i++) \n    {\n        printf(\"%d * %d = %d \\n\", n, i, n * i); \n    }\n \n    return 0;\n}\n\nOutput:\n5 * 1 = 5\n5 * 2 = 10\n5 * 3 = 15\n5 * 4 = 20\n5 * 5 = 25\n5 * 6 = 30\n5 * 7 = 35\n5 * 8 = 40\n5 * 9 = 45\n5 * 10 = 50",
